 which such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n<b>electricity</b> has taken place cannot ... such by the State Government;\n\n     (b) &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot; means the\nusage of <b>electricity</b> -\n \n    (i) by any artificial means", "docsize": 111519, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Karnataka High Court", "author": "H P Sandesh", "authorEncoded": "h-p-sandesh"}, {"tid": 160281331, "catids": null, "doctype": 1021, "publishdate": "2025-09-09", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Etendtra Kumar Ghambhir vs Madhya Pradesh Madhya Ksetra Vidhyut ... on 9 September, 2025", "numcites": 24, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "expression &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot; under  <b>section</b> <b>126</b>  of\n                          the 2003 Act deals with cases of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>, even in the\n                          absence ... under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>(1)  of the Act only. There\n                          is apparent distinction between  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  and  <b>Section</b> 135  of the\n                          Act.  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  forms part", "docsize": 82372, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Madhya Pradesh High Court"}, {"tid": 61667097, "catids": null, "doctype": 1011, "publishdate": "2025-08-21", "authorid": 2066, "bench": [2066], "title": "Page No.# 1/26 vs Assam Power Distribution Company ... on 21 August, 2025", "numcites": 16, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "expression &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n<b>electricity</b>&quot; under <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> of the 2003 Act deals with cases of\n<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>, even in the absence ... under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>(1)  of the Act only. There is apparent\ndistinction between <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> and  <b>Section</b> 135  of the Act. <b>Section</b>\n<b>126</b> forms part", "docsize": 52244, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gauhati High Court", "author": "D Baruah", "authorEncoded": "d-baruah"}, {"tid": 183029280, "catids": null, "doctype": 1006, "publishdate": "2023-04-04", "authorid": 573, "bench": [573], "title": "Badal Chandra Shit vs State Of West Bengal And Others on 4 April, 2023", "numcites": 21, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>Sections</b> 135  to  140  and  <b>Section</b> 150 &quot;.\n \n 30.   Therefore, whereas  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  assesses the <b>electricity</b> charges\n\n      payable for <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> ... definition in  <b>Section</b> 135  and reach the domain of &#x27;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>&#x27;\n\n      of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> . Moreover, the standards of proof in\n\n      both", "docsize": 45250, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Calcutta High Court (Appellete Side)", "author": "S Bhattacharyya", "authorEncoded": "s-bhattacharyya"}, {"tid": 92759678, "catids": null, "doctype": 1019, "publishdate": "2022-06-15", "authorid": 955, "bench": [955], "title": "M/S Shyam Lal Iron And Steel Company vs Jharkhand Urja Vikas Nigam Limited on 15 June, 2022", "numcites": 19, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "energy, on\n                   account of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of energy. The\n                   <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> is defined under\n                    <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> ... under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>(1)  of the Act only.\nThere is apparent distinction between  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> \nand  <b>Section</b> 135  of the Act.  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  forms part", "docsize": 59144, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "R Shankar", "authorEncoded": "r-shankar"}, {"tid": 51255397, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2019-09-30", "authorid": null, "bench": [1240, 95], "title": "Rakesh Singh vs State Of U.P.Thru.Prin.Secy. Energy & ... on 30 September, 2019", "numcites": 24, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&#x27;. <b>Unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has been defined in Explanation (b), as quoted above. The definition of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> ... <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&#x27; and the theft of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> 135  is also an <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> for which assessment is contemplated", "docsize": 46876, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 119288334, "catids": [1], "doctype": 1015, "publishdate": "2013-05-17", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Executive Engineer (<b>Electrical</b>) vs Appellate Authority-Cum-Dy. ... on 17 May, 2013", "numcites": 23, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "expression\n   *\n\n  &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot; under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of\nthe 2003 Act deals with cases of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>,\neven in the absence ... stated    circumstances      of\n&quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>&quot; in the <b>section</b> cannot be construed\nas exhaustive. The &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>&quot;\n  would mean what", "docsize": 68079, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Orissa High Court"}, {"tid": 98964779, "catids": [175], "doctype": 1009, "publishdate": "1800-01-01", "authorid": 328, "bench": [328], "title": "Smt.M.Varalakshmi And Others vs The Superintending Engineer ...", "numcites": 24, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>unauthorised</b>\n<b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>, whereas Clause No.10 dealt with theft of\n<b>electricity</b>.  Since  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the Act deals with\npilferage/<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> ... illustratively\nstated circumstances of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> in the <b>section</b> cannot\nbe construed as exhaustive.  The <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>\nwould mean what is stated under", "docsize": 40989, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Andhra HC (Pre-Telangana)", "author": "A R Rao", "authorEncoded": "a-r-rao"}, {"tid": 165462249, "catids": null, "doctype": 1011, "publishdate": "2025-10-13", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Page No.# 1/16 vs Assam Power Distribution Company Ltd. ... on 13 October, 2025", "numcites": 15, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> under\n       <b>section</b> <b>126</b>  and the offence of theft of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>section</b>\n      135  of the Act, 2003.  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  provides ... <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n      <b>electricity</b> simpliciter but includes such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n      <b>electricity</b> when there is an allegation of theft of <b>electricity</b>\n      defined under  <b>section</b>", "docsize": 32860, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gauhati High Court"}], "found": "21 - 30 of 884", "encodedformInput": "%22section%20126%22%20electricity%20%22unauthorised%20use%22%20doctypes%3Ahighcourts"}